#: catalog/admin.py:603 catalog/admin.py:1632 catalog/admin.py:1824
msgid "Plan"
msgstr "Tarif"

#: catalog/admin.py:605
msgid "Data & validity"
msgstr "Trafik va muddat"

#: catalog/admin.py:619
msgid "Supplier sourcing"
msgstr "Ta’minot manbasi"

#: catalog/admin.py:623
msgid ""
"Add each supplier's wholesale price under 'Supplier offers' at the bottom of "
"this page. On save the cheapest available one sets the cost, the price, and "
"where the order is placed; the rest become fallbacks used when the winner is "
"out of stock."
msgstr ""
"Har bir ta’minotchining ulgurji narxini shu sahifaning pastidagi "
"«Ta’minotchi takliflari» bo‘limiga kiriting. Saqlanganda mavjudlari ichidan "
"eng arzoni tannarxni, narxni va buyurtma qayerga berilishini belgilaydi; "
"qolganlari g‘olib tugaganda ishlatiladigan zaxiraga aylanadi."

#: catalog/admin.py:631
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Narxlash"

#: catalog/admin.py:642
msgid ""
"Enter the supplier cost and the price is calculated on save. Leave the "
"markup empty to inherit a pricing rule; fill it in to override every rule "
"for this plan alone. Tick 'price locked' to type a price by hand and stop it "
"being recalculated. Use the note for anything the number cannot say on its "
"own, such as '+ deposit' — it is shown to customers beside the price."
msgstr ""
"Ta’minotchi tannarxini kiriting — narx saqlanganda hisoblanadi. Ustamani "
"bo‘sh qoldirsangiz narxlash qoidasi qo‘llanadi; to‘ldirsangiz faqat shu "
"tarif uchun barcha qoidalar ustidan o‘tadi. Narxni qo‘lda yozib, qayta "
"hisoblanishini to‘xtatish uchun «narx qulflangan» ni belgilang. Sonning o‘zi "
"ayta olmaydigan narsa uchun izohdan foydalaning, masalan «+ depozit» — u "
"mijozga narx yonida ko‘rsatiladi."

#: catalog/admin.py:651
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Ko‘rinishi"

#: catalog/admin.py:731
