#: templates/admin/catalog/ai_pricing.html:178
msgid "Applies to"
msgstr "Qo‘llanadi"

#: catalog/admin.py:1284
msgid ""
"The narrowest rule about a tariff wins. In order: this destination AND this "
"size, then this size everywhere, then this destination, then this supplier, "
"then the house default. Leave the size empty unless the rule is about one."
msgstr ""
"Tarif haqidagi eng aniq qoida g‘olib bo‘ladi. Tartib: shu yo‘nalish VA shu "
"o‘lcham, keyin shu o‘lcham hamma yerda, keyin shu yo‘nalish, keyin shu "
"ta’minotchi, oxirida uy standarti. Qoida bitta o‘lcham haqida bo‘lmasa, "
"o‘lchamni bo‘sh qoldiring."

