msgid "Wholesaler"
msgstr "Ulgurji ta’minotchi"

#: catalog/forms.py:17
msgid "Which supplier's price list this file is."
msgstr "Bu fayl qaysi ta’minotchining narxlar ro‘yxati."

#: catalog/forms.py:20
msgid "Price list (CSV)"
msgstr "Narxlar ro‘yxati (CSV)"

#: catalog/forms.py:22
msgid ""
"Needs the columns package_code, location, data_gb, days, cost_usd. The "
"export from the supplier's portal already has them."
msgstr ""
"package_code, location, data_gb, days, cost_usd ustunlari kerak. Ta’minotchi "
"portalidan yuklab olingan faylda ular allaqachon bor."

#: catalog/forms.py:29
msgid "Preview only — do not write anything"
msgstr "Faqat ko‘rib chiqish — hech narsa yozilmaydi"

#: catalog/forms.py:31
msgid ""
"Leave this on the first time. Applying moves supplier costs, which moves "
"retail prices through the pricing rules."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi marta buni yoqilgan qoldiring. Qo‘llash ta’minotchi tannarxlarini "
"o‘zgartiradi, bu esa narxlash qoidalari orqali chakana narxlarni "
"o‘zgartiradi."

#: catalog/forms.py:43
msgid "Limit to these destinations"
msgstr "Faqat shu yo‘nalishlar bilan cheklash"

#: catalog/forms.py:46
msgid ""
"ISO codes, comma-separated. Leave empty to apply the whole file — naming "
"destinations is how you set one up without repricing the rest."
msgstr ""
"ISO kodlar, vergul bilan. Butun faylni qo‘llash uchun bo‘sh qoldiring — "
"yo‘nalish nomlash qolganlarining narxini o‘zgartirmasdan bittasini sozlash "
"usuli."

