#: templates/admin/catalog/ai_pricing.html:94
msgid ""
"Write what you want in plain Uzbek. The assistant turns it into pricing "
"rules, the server works out <b>exactly</b> which prices would move — using "
"the same code that prices the catalogue — and shows you before anything is "
"saved. Nothing is written until you approve it, and a tariff whose price you "
"typed by hand is never touched."
msgstr ""
"Nima xohlaganingizni oddiy o'zbekchada yozing. Yordamchi uni narx "
"qoidalariga aylantiradi, server esa katalogni narxlaydigan o'sha kodning "
"o'zi bilan qaysi narxlar <b>aynan</b> o'zgarishini hisoblab, saqlanishidan "
"oldin ko'rsatadi. Siz tasdiqlamaguningizcha hech narsa yozilmaydi, va "
"narxini qo'lda yozgan tarifingizga hech qachon tegilmaydi."

#: templates/admin/catalog/ai_pricing.html:105
msgid ""
"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is not set on the server, so the assistant cannot be "
"reached. Pricing rules can still be written by hand on the rules page."
msgstr ""
"Serverda ANTHROPIC_API_KEY ko'rsatilmagan, shuning uchun yordamchiga ulanib "
"bo'lmaydi. Narx qoidalarini qoidalar sahifasida qo'lda yozish mumkin."

#: templates/admin/catalog/ai_pricing.html:114
msgid "What should change?"
msgstr "Nima o'zgarsin?"

#: templates/admin/catalog/ai_pricing.html:116
#, python-format
msgid ""
"e.g. Every 1 GB tariff should earn 200%%, and nothing may make less than "
"half a dollar."
msgstr ""
"masalan: Har bir 1 GB tarif 200%% ustama bilan sotilsin va hech biri yarim "
"dollardan kam foyda keltirmasin."

#: templates/admin/catalog/ai_pricing.html:120
msgid "Show me what would change"
msgstr "Nima o'zgarishini ko'rsating"

#: templates/admin/catalog/ai_pricing.html:122
#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:80
msgid "Margin report"
msgstr "Ustama hisoboti"

#: templates/admin/catalog/ai_pricing.html:123
msgid "Rules by hand"
