msgid ""
"%(total)s tariffs earn less than $%(limit)s on a sale — roughly what a card "
"fee takes. The %(shown)s thinnest are listed; the markup is fixed on the "
"pricing assistant or the price sheet, by traffic size rather than one tariff "
"at a time."
msgstr ""
"%(total)s ta tarif sotuvdan $%(limit)s dan kam foyda keltiradi — bu taxminan "
"karta komissiyasi olib qoladigan miqdor. Eng kamlaridan %(shown)s tasi "
"ro'yxatda; ustama narx yordamchisida yoki narxlar varag'ida, bitta tarif "
"emas, trafik o'lchami bo'yicha tuzatiladi."

