msgid "Top up in their portal"
msgstr "Ularning kabinetida to'ldirish"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:110
msgid ""
"A wallet is empty. A customer can be charged and still get no eSIM, because "
"the purchase from the wholesaler is refused. Card payments stay switched off "
"until at least one wallet is funded."
msgstr ""
"Hisob bo'sh. Mijozdan pul olinib, eSIM berilmasligi mumkin — chunki "
"ulgurjidan sotib olish rad etiladi. Kamida bitta hisob to'lmaguncha karta "
"to'lovi o'chirilgan holda qoladi."

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:119
msgid ""
"<b>Topping up cannot be done from here.</b> Neither reseller API has a "
"deposit endpoint — they let us read the balance, list packages and buy an "
"eSIM, and nothing else. Money goes into a wallet through the supplier's own "
"portal, by bank transfer, card or USDT depending on the supplier. The links "
"above go straight there."
msgstr ""
"<b>Bu yerdan to'ldirib bo'lmaydi.</b> Ikkala reseller API'da ham depozit "
"endpointi yo'q — ular faqat balansni o'qish, paketlar ro'yxatini olish va "
"eSIM sotib olishga ruxsat beradi. Pul ta'minotchining o'z kabinetidan "
"tushadi: bank o'tkazmasi, karta yoki USDT — ta'minotchiga qarab. Yuqoridagi "
"havolalar to'g'ridan-to'g'ri o'sha yerga olib boradi."

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:129
msgid "Who is cheaper"
msgstr "Qaysi biri arzon"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:131
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Counted over the %(both)s tariffs both suppliers carry. This is not money "
"waiting to be saved — every tariff is already bought from whichever of the "
"two is cheaper. It is the answer to a different question: how much we lean "
"on each supplier, and which one it would hurt to lose."
msgstr ""
"Ikkala ta'minotchi ham sotadigan %(both)s tarif bo'yicha hisoblangan. Bu "
"tejash mumkin bo'lgan pul emas — har bir tarif allaqachon ikkisining "
"arzonrog'idan olinadi. Bu boshqa savolga javob: har bir ta'minotchiga "
"qanchalik bog'liqmiz va qaysi birini yo'qotish og'irroq tegadi."

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:142
msgid "Tariffs offered"
msgstr "Taklif qiladigan tariflari"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:143
msgid "Cheaper on"
msgstr "Arzonroq"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:144
msgid "We buy from them"
msgstr "Biz ulardan olamiz"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:145
msgid "Only they have"
msgstr "Faqat ularda bor"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:146
msgid "Sold"
msgstr "Sotilgan"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:156
#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s destinations"
msgstr "%(n)s yo'nalish"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:164
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(n)s tariffs are bought from the more expensive of the two. Re-run the "
"catalogue sync — sourcing picks the cheapest offer on save, so this means a "
"price moved without the plan being written."
msgstr ""
"%(n)s tarif ikkisining qimmatrog'idan olinyapti. Katalog sinxronizatsiyasini "
"qayta ishga tushiring — manba saqlanganda eng arzon taklif tanlanadi, ya'ni "
"bu narx o'zgargani, lekin tarif qayta yozilmaganini bildiradi."

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:172
msgid ""
"Every tariff with two offers is bought from the cheaper one — checked, not "
"assumed."
msgstr ""
"Ikki taklifi bor har bir tarif arzonrog'idan olinadi — tekshirildi, taxmin "
"qilinmadi."

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:178
msgid "Destination by destination"
msgstr "Yo'nalish bo'yicha"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:180
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Both suppliers sell in %(both)s of %(total)s destinations. Ordered by the "
"biggest price gap between them, which is where losing one supplier would "
"cost the most."
msgstr ""
"%(total)s yo'nalishdan %(both)s tasida ikkala ta'minotchi ham sotadi. Eng "
"katta narx farqi bo'yicha tartiblangan — bitta ta'minotchini yo'qotish eng "
"qimmatga tushadigan joylar."

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:191
msgid "eSIM Access"
msgstr "eSIM Access"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:192
msgid "eSIMCard"
msgstr "eSIMCard"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:193
msgid "Cheaper"
msgstr "Arzonroq"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:194
msgid "Biggest gap"
msgstr "Eng katta farq"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:195
msgid "Lowest cost"
msgstr "Eng past tannarx"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:205
msgid "only Access"
msgstr "faqat Access"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:206
msgid "only Card"
msgstr "faqat Card"

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:219
msgid "No supplier offers yet."
msgstr "Hali ta'minotchi taklifi yo'q."

#: templates/admin/catalog/supplier_board.html:228
msgid ""
"Nothing has sold yet, so \"sold\" and \"purchases recorded\" are empty. They "
"fill in on their own from the first real order — the purchase ledger records "
"every wholesaler buy, so no figure here is ever typed by hand."
msgstr ""
"Hali hech narsa sotilmagan, shuning uchun «sotilgan» va «xarid yozilgan» "
"bo'sh. Ular birinchi real buyurtmadan o'zi to'ladi — xaridlar daftari har "
"bir ulgurji xaridni yozib boradi, ya'ni bu yerdagi hech bir raqam qo'lda "
